{#
    Shared UI helpers. Import with {% import '_macros.html.twig' as ui %}.

    Icons are inline SVG with presentation attributes only (no style attribute), so they pass
    the strict Content-Security-Policy. They are decorative: the surrounding control carries the
    accessible name.
#}

